### check: sealed_sys_kind_of (`oodac/check_cap_util.oo`)

| Sealed name | Preferred kind | Soft? |
|-------------|----------------|-------|
| `async_spawn_internal` | **ProcessCap** | yes (SysCap supersede via `is_soft_sys_kind`) |
